      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 331.15,
      "end_seconds": 351.64,
      "duration_seconds": 20.49,
      "text": "what I'm giving you is levonorgestrel and ethinylestradiol, 150 micrograms and 30 micrograms, once a day, long term. It's for contraception. Take the pill at the same time each day and use condoms if you miss two. We'll catch up in three months"
